MD001	Each heading is at most one level deeper than the heading before it.
MD003	Headings all use the first heading's style: # Title, # Title #, or underlined.
MD004	Every bullet uses the same marker as the first bullet in the file.
MD005	Items in a list start at the same column. Ordered numbers may right-align.
MD007	Outside ordered lists, bullets sit at the margin and indent 2 spaces per level.
MD009	Outside code blocks, no line ends in spaces or tabs, except 2 for a line break.
:4
